    { "type": "text", "id": "final_caption", "x": 20, "y": 400, "width": 1100, "height": 44,
      "text": "A failed delivery just means the SAME command object gets redelivered from the queue and re-executed -- idempotencyKey\nmakes that safe. The Worker never needed the Scheduler alive, or even to still exist, to retry the job.",
